@crew v-ellery-teo
// Writer 4, batch 5: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello hello! Teo Ellery. Do you own a kettle? I have a better one.   #funny
- Hiya! Just passing. Unless you need a kettle. Do you need a kettle?   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}! Two kettles sold. Three, if Brennan says yes. She won't.   #funny
?

== chat
- Lesson one of the trade: everybody needs a kettle. They just don't know it.   #funny
- Your garden's the best part of this ship. No sales in here. Promise.

== near
? place:hydroponics_garden
- No kettles in the garden. That's my rule. Lovely here.
? place:crew_store
- Your storekeepers drive a hard bargain. I've learnt a lot.   #funny
?

== bye
- {bye}! If the kettle question changes, you know where I am.   #funny

== smalltalk
- Kettle? No? Fair enough.   #funny
- Lovely garden.
